OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal 1,000-tonne waste mountain
OL,4,Adiscovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation after an estimated 1,000
OL,8,Ftonnes of shredded household and
OL,9,Fcommercial waste was illegally dumped
OL,10,Fin West Yorkshire.
OL,12,FOfficers attended the site in Birstall
OL,13,Fon 4 November following reports piles
OL,14,Fof waste had been left on land off
OL,15,FBankwood Way near industrial and
OL,16,Fcommercial premises.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
