OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal 1,000-tonne waste mountain
OL,4,Adiscovered
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Investigators are following up several
OL,7,Flines of enquiry to track down those
OL,8,Fresponsible and have worked with the
OL,9,Flandowner to secure the site and
OL,10,Fprevent further deposits," an
OL,11,FEnvironmental Agency spokesperson said.
OL,13,FThey appealed to anyone with
OL,14,Finformation about the incident to get
OL,15,Fin touch.
